WEBVTT

00:23:58.408 --> 00:24:00.656
to beam shapes to the outside.

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:04.026
CH: The first message that we put up
was this big heart.

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:07.946
Think about these warm bulbs in 52 rooms

00:24:07.970 --> 00:24:10.046
that just emanates from the building

00:24:10.070 --> 00:24:12.846
to create this kind of glow outside.

00:24:12.870 --> 00:24:16.566
AG: A few days later, they changed
the lights to form another message.

00:24:16.590 --> 00:24:19.286
This time, they beamed out one word.

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:21.436
CH: We did "hope," we put H-O-P-E,

00:24:21.460 --> 00:24:25.176
so you can see very clearly
"hope" glowing in the night.

00:24:25.200 --> 00:24:27.736
AG: Because the hotel is so close to DC,

00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:31.356
anyone going in or out of the city
could see the lights.